{"2464060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZYNDECK VX: Card Battler", "steam_appid": 2464060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZYNDECK VX: CARD BATTLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZYNDECK VX</strong> is a fast-paced Tactical RPG that fuses real-time grid combat with deck-building strategy. Build your own <strong>customized deck</strong> of battle VX-Cards to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT POWERFUL ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy heaven by challenging the <strong>Angel Masters</strong>, the most powerful entities in the realm. Collect cards and upgrade your passive abilities to stand a chance against them, but be warned, they are incredibly strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE IN THE SCHOOL OF BABEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Eva</strong>, the only human among the angels of Heaven. In the School of Babel, angels are trained to pray, obey, and become powerful soldiers to defeat demons. But what happens when the Angel Masters reveal themselves as authoritarian entities, and Eva’s human emotions flourish to defy the regime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR VX-CARD COMBOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loadout defines your playstyle. With over <strong>150 VX-Cards</strong> to collect, you can engineer distinct combat kits. During combat, enter the <strong>VX-Card Pick Phase</strong> to assemble your strategy, then adapt on the fly as you acquire new cards and create powerful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZYNDECK VX: CARD BATTLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZYNDECK VX</strong> is a fast-paced Tactical RPG that fuses real-time grid combat with deck-building strategy. Build your own <strong>customized deck</strong> of battle VX-Cards to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/c1bed6316665229c91a30349f2987800.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT POWERFUL ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy heaven by challenging the <strong>Angel Masters</strong>, the most powerful entities in the realm. Collect cards and upgrade your passive abilities to stand a chance against them, but be warned, they are incredibly strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/fb2fbf778b000e0ade90e96c855fef18.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE IN THE SCHOOL OF BABEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Eva</strong>, the only human among the angels of Heaven. In the School of Babel, angels are trained to pray, obey, and become powerful soldiers to defeat demons. But what happens when the Angel Masters reveal themselves as authoritarian entities, and Eva’s human emotions flourish to defy the regime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.poster.avif?t=1786720759\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.webm?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/extras/2b8bf70fd65cc08b07df972e436289dc.mp4?t=1786720759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR VX-CARD COMBOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loadout defines your playstyle. With over <strong>150 VX-Cards</strong> to collect, you can engineer distinct combat kits. During combat, enter the <strong>VX-Card Pick Phase</strong> to assemble your strategy, then adapt on the fly as you acquire new cards and create powerful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ZYNDECK VX is a fast-paced Tactical RPG that fuses real-time grid combat with deck-building strategy. Dash through bullet-hell arenas and build a unique loadout from over 150 VX-Cards. Live the life of Eva, the only human in a school of angels in Heaven. Can you reclaim Eden from the regime?", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/12bfdf73881ce548bf7c860b4b23a2fbf7d751a3/header.jpg?t=1786720759", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/933b3e090979639e745e2239f4fffe8c12b046ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786720759", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464060/933b3e090979639e745